    title: "Marriage After Children: Rediscovering Each Other",
    slug: "marriage-after-children",
    excerpt:
      "Children do not ruin marriages — but they do expose every fault line that was already there, and the couple that does not fight for its identity apart from the children will one day discover that the children were the only thing holding them together.",
